    narr:generatedFrom "bb6d44fa6cc965e66aa05e25f3558caef9d1e0ec" ;
    narr:narration """This narrative carries a settled ruling on reaction delivery, re-recorded across four passes. [The framing of where reaction delivery belongs](narr:Expr_20260924_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_hf8fb95c0b315_1) grounds [the directive that every reaction routes through one bundle per run per person, not one message per skill](narr:Expr_20260924_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_hf8fb95c0b315_2). The ruling was held under pressure — [the pushback on the batching window, answered by the rule that a bundle closes when the run closes and a late skill waits for the next run](narr:Expr_20260924_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_hf8fb95c0b315_3). [The rejected alternative of per-skill delivery with client-side collapsing](narr:Expr_20260924_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_hf8fb95c0b315_4) is recorded with [the same rejection rationale stated separately](narr:Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_5). Earlier passes re-record the arc as [framing](narr:Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_1), [directive](narr:Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_2), [pushback exchange](narr:Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_3), and [rejected alternative](narr:Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_4), and a second pass repeats it as [framing](narr:Expr_3DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_1), [directive](narr:Expr_3DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_2), [pushback](narr:Expr_3DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_3), and [alternative](narr:Expr_3DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_4). A fourth pass now repeats the same arc as [framing](narr:Expr_20260924_2_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_haec961429483_1), [directive](narr:Expr_20260924_2_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_haec961429483_2), [pushback](narr:Expr_20260924_2_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_haec961429483_3), and [alternative](narr:Expr_20260924_2_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_haec961429483_4). The whole arc supports [the position on where bundling and batching windows should be bounded](narr:Position_ReactionDeliveryBundlingAndBatchingBoundary).""" ;
    narr:reaction """One thing moved: a fourth pass of the same arc landed as [framing](narr:Expr_20260924_2_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_haec961429483_1), [directive](narr:Expr_20260924_2_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_haec961429483_2), [pushback](narr:Expr_20260924_2_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_haec961429483_3), and [alternative](narr:Expr_20260924_2_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_haec961429483_4), so the ruling is now re-recorded across four passes rather than three. Substantively nothing moved — the new pass repeats the framing, directive, pushback, and rejected alternative verbatim, and the prior narration's arc still holds.""" ;
